 "result": "The failing call is at `src/tessel/sessions.py:374`, in `SignedCookieSessionInterface.persist_session`:\n\n```python\nresponse.set_cookie(\n    name,\n    val,\n    expires=expires,\n    httponly=httponly,\n    domain=domain,\n    path=path,\n    secure=secure,\n    partitioned=partitioned,\n    samesite=samesite,\n)\n```\n\nThe installed Werkzeug 3.0.3 rejects the **`partitioned`** keyword argument, with `TypeError: Response.set_cookie() got an unexpected keyword argument 'partitioned'`. The value comes from `self.get_cookie_partitioned(app)` a few lines earlier.\n\nThe `delete_cookie(...)` call in the same function (when the session is emptied) also passes `partitioned=partitioned`. No test hit that path, so it never raised, but it would fail the same way.",
